:: Heist Landry Begin
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<npc Landry>><<person1>>
<<bankHeistMickeyReadyCheck>>
<<if !_mickeyReady>>
	"So," Landry says, folding <<his>> hands and watching you carefully. "You and Wren. Ready?"
	<br><br>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>"As ready as I'll ever be," you say, trying not to let your nerves show.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>"I think so," you say quietly. "As ready as I can be."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>"We are," you say. "As much as we can be."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>"Ready enough," you say with a bright little smile.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>"We'll do our best," you say, keeping your voice steady.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>"We're ready," you say. "Let's get on with it."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>"If we're not, we'll learn quickly enough," you say coolly.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>"Born ready. Let's do this," you say.
	<<else>>"We're ready," you confirm.<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Landry glances at Mickey's door and raps on it twice. "Ready?"
	<br><br>
	The door opens and Mickey peers out. "I'm not. The camera system keeps changing its code. I need to learn the pattern before I can shut the feed off safely. If I force it, a silent alarm goes off.
	<span class="teal"><<print _mickeyDaysLeft>> more day<<if _mickeyDaysLeft isnot 1>>s<</if>></span>. Don't rush me."
	<br><br>
	The door clicks shut. You hear the heavy lock click into place.
	<br><br>
	Landry shrugs. "You heard them. Come back later."
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	"So," Landry says. "You and Wren. Ready?"
	<br><br>
	Before you can answer, Mickey's door opens. They hold out a small object: a tiny skin-coloured earpiece, hardly bigger than a pea.
	"Put this in when you get to the bank. I'll be on the other end. I can watch the cameras, track the guards, and shut off the service floor cameras for thirty seconds when you need it. One blackout. That's all I get before the backup notices."
	<br><br>
	They fix you with a hard look. "When you're done, win or lose, you destroy this. Snap it, crush it, swallow it... no, leave that one. Chew it first if you must. It carries my signal trail.
	<span class="red">If anyone finds it, they find me</span>."
	<br><br>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>"I understand," you say, taking the earpiece with careful fingers.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>"Right," you murmur. "I'll make sure it's gone."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>"Understood," you say. "It will not be found."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>"Darling, this will vanish," you say as you slip it into your palm.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>"I'll deal with it properly," you say softly, slipping the earpiece away.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>"Understood. It disappears the moment we're done," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>"Then nobody's finding it," you say, pocketing the earpiece.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>"Chew and swallow it. Got it." You pocket the earpiece.<br><br>"Don't be cute," they say. The door shuts. You hear the complex lock set into place.
	<<else>>You take the earpiece and nod. "It won't be found."<br><br>Mickey nods once and retreats. The door clicks shut.<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $xchange.bankHeist.hasEarpiece to true>><<set $xchange.bankHeist.heistStarted to true>>
	Landry leans forward. "<span class="teal">Tonight. After midnight. Wren meets you at the bank</span>. The guards change shifts at 2 a.m." <<He>> meets your eyes. "If you get caught, you're on your own."
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Begin
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<npc Wren>><<person1>>
The streets are empty. The bank stands dark against the sky, its marble front wet with drizzle.
<br><br>
You press the earpiece into your ear. A faint crackle noise answers you, then Mickey's voice slips in. "Can you hear me? Good-good. Don't talk back unless you have to."
<br><br>
A hand touches your elbow. Wren appears beside you in dark clothes. <<His>> eyes catch the streetlight for a moment.
"Right on time." <<He>> nods towards the east side. "Maintenance hatch. Thirty metres. Stay close."
<br><br>
<<link [[Follow Wren|Heist Entry]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Entry
<<effects>><<if $avery_fate is "ascended">><<location "avery_skyscraper">><<else>><<location "office">><</if>><<effects>>
The maintenance hatch is exactly where you marked it. Wren crouches beside it and gets to work without a word. Metal scrapes softly against metal. Then the grate comes free with a click.
<br><br>
You slide into a narrow utility corridor. The air is stale. Orange emergency lights spill across the floor. Wren drops in behind you and puts the grate back.
<br><br>
Mickey's voice crackles in your ear. "I can see the service floor cameras. Two guards. One walking around, one near the vault stairs. I'll guide you through."
<br><br>
Wren taps your shoulder. "I'll watch behind us. You lead. If anything goes wrong back there, I'll handle it."
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak to {
	position: 3, progress: 0, turns: 0, action: "none",
	guardA: 1, guardADir: 1, guardB: 5, guardBAlert: false,
	cameraBlackout: 0, peeked: false, wrenFreebie: true
}>>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel to 0>>
<<link [[Enter the service corridor|Heist Corridor]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Corridor
<<effects>>
<<set _s to $xchange.bankHeist.sneak>>
<<set _heist to $xchange.bankHeist>>
/* ============= PROCESS ACTION ============= */
<<switch _s.action>>
	<<case "dash">>
		You leave cover and hurry towards the next section.
		<<set _distA to Math.abs(_s.guardA - _s.position)>>
		<<if _distA lte 1 and _s.cameraBlackout lte 0>>
			<<if _s.wrenFreebie>>
				<<set _s.wrenFreebie to false>>
				Wren grabs your collar and pulls you behind a support pillar. The patrol guard walks right past, close enough to touch.
				<br><br>
				"Careful," Wren breathes. <span class="red">You won't get that lucky again.</span>
				<<set _heist.alertLevel += 1>>
			<<else>>
				The patrol guard spots you. "Hey! Who's there?"
				<<set _caught to true>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			You reach the next section without trouble.
			<<set _s.progress += 1>>
		<</if>>
	<<case "sneak">>
		You press against the wall and move forward bit by bit.
		<<bankHeistStealthCheck 4 "skulduggery">>
		<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
			You move quietly. <span class="green">Clean move.</span>
			<<set _s.progress += 1>>
		<<else>>
			Your foot scrapes the floor. A guard stops to listen.
			<<if random(1,100) lte 60>>
				After a long moment, the guard starts walking again. Your nerves are shaken, but you move forward.
				<<set _s.progress += 1>><<set _heist.alertLevel += 1>>
			<<else>>
				<<if _s.wrenFreebie>>
					<<set _s.wrenFreebie to false>>
					Wren throws a coin down the other corridor. The guard turns. You slip past.
					<br><br>
					"Owe me one," Wren whispers.
					<<set _s.progress += 1>>
				<<else>>
					The guard's torch sweeps over you. "I see you. Don't move."
					<<set _caught to true>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<case "hide">>
		You press into a shallow doorway and hold still.
		<<set _distA to Math.abs(_s.guardA - _s.position)>>
		<<if _distA lte 1>>
			The patrol guard walks past. <<if $skulduggery gte 400>>You keep your breathing steady. <<He>> does not notice you.<<else>>You hold your breath. <<He>> pauses, then moves on.<</if>>
		<<else>>
			Nothing happens. The corridor is quiet.
		<</if>>
	<<case "peek">>
		You lean out from cover and check the corridor.
		<<set _s.peeked to true>>
	<<case "camera">>
		<<if _s.cameraBlackout lte 0>>
			<<speechresolve>>
			<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>You press two fingers to the earpiece. "Could you kill the cameras, please?"
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>You lower your voice to a breath. "Cameras. Now, please."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>You touch the earpiece. "Kill the cameras, please."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>You murmur into the earpiece, "Lights out for me, darling."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>You whisper into the earpiece. "Kill the cameras."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>You tap the earpiece. "Kill the cameras. Now."
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>"Blind them," you whisper into the earpiece.
			<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>"Kill the cameras," you whisper. "Now."
			<<else>>You whisper into the earpiece. "Kill the cameras."
			<</if>>
			<<set _s.cameraBlackout to 3>><<set _s.cameraBlackoutUse to true>>
		<<else>>
			Mickey says, "The blackout is already running. Don't waste it."
		<</if>>
	<<case "wait">>
		You stay still and listen. Pipes click in the walls. Somewhere, a guard's boot squeaks on tile.
	<<default>>
	<<if _s.action isnot "none">><<set _s.action to "none">><</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
/* ============= CHECK STATE ============= */
<<if _caught>>
	The guard calls it in. More footsteps. Lots of them.
	<br><br>
	Wren grabs your arm. "We're blown. Run!"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Run|Heist Failure]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Surrender|Heist Failure Surrender]]>><</link>>
<<elseif _s.progress gte 4>>
	You reach the service door. The electronic lock blinks red. Wren is already working on it.
	<br><br>
	Mickey says, "I can see you at the door. You're through. I lose camera cover past here. The vault floor has its own system.
	But before that, hold..."
	<br><br>
	The electronic lock now blinks <span class="green">green.</span> The door clicks open.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Descend to the vault|Heist Vault Door]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	/* ============= CONTINUE LOOP ============= */
	<<bankHeistMoveGuards>>
	<<bankHeistMickeyHint>>
	<<switch _s.progress>>
		<<case 0>><span class="pink">You're at the corridor entrance. The vault stairs are far ahead.</span>
		<<case 1>><span class="purple">You've passed the first section.</span>
		<<case 2>><span class="blue">Halfway through the service corridor.</span>
		<<case 3>><span class="teal">Almost there. One more section to the vault door.</span>
	<</switch>>
	<<switch _heist.alertLevel>>
		<<case 0>><span class="green">The guards have no idea you're here.</span>
		<<case 1>><span class="purple">The guards seem a little tense.</span>
		<<case 2>><span class="pink">The guards are alert.</span>
		<<case 3>><span class="red">The guards are actively searching.</span>
	<</switch>>
	<<if _s.peeked>>
		<br>
		<<set _distA to Math.abs(_s.guardA - _s.position)>>
		<<set _distB to Math.abs(_s.guardB - _s.position)>>
		<<if _distA lte 1>><span class="red">The patrol guard is right next to you!</span>
		<<elseif _distA lte 2>><span class="pink">You can see the patrol guard nearby, <<if _s.guardADir gt 0>>moving towards you<<else>>moving away<</if>>.</span>
		<<else>><span class="teal">The patrol guard is far enough away.</span><</if>>
		<br>
		<<if _distB lte 1>><span class="red">The stationary guard is very close.</span>
		<<elseif _distB lte 2>><span class="purple">The stationary guard is a short distance away.</span>
		<<else>><span class="teal">The stationary guard is not a concern right now.</span><</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<caveicon "north">><<link [[Dash forward|Heist Corridor]]>><<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak.action to "dash">><</link>><<note "Fast, risky" "pink">>
	<br>
	<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[Sneak forward|Heist Corridor]]>><<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak.action to "sneak">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<br>
	<<crimeicon>><<link [[Hide|Heist Corridor]]>><<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak.action to "hide">><</link>><<note "Wait for guards to pass" "teal">>
	<br>
	<<crimeicon "mark">><<link [[Peek|Heist Corridor]]>><<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak.action to "peek">><</link>><<note "Check guard positions" "blue">>
	<br>
	<<loitericon>><<link [[Wait|Heist Corridor]]>><<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak.action to "wait">><</link>><<note "Guards shift positions" "teal">>
	<br>
	<<if _s.cameraBlackout lte 0 and !_s.cameraBlackoutUse>>
		<br>
		<<techicon "monitors">><<link [[Use camera blackout|Heist Corridor]]>><<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak.action to "camera">><</link>><<note "One-time, 3 turns" "gold">>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Vault Door
<<effects>>
The staircase is longer than expected. The walls change from plaster to concrete, then to stone. The air gets colder.
<br><br>
<<if $awarelevel gte 5>>
	<span class="erase-from-history"><span class="navy">A prickling feeling runs across your scalp. You have felt this before. In the temple, in the forest. The feeling of being watched by something without eyes.
	<br><br></span></span>
<</if>>
At the bottom waits a heavy steel door with an old combination lock. It is thick, old-fashioned, and built to make people give up.
Wren studies it and smirks. "Old school. I love old school."
<br><br>
<<He>> presses <<his>> ear to the metal and starts turning the dial.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Vault Door 2]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Vault Door 2
<<effects>><<bankHeistStealthCheck 6 "skulduggery">>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	The lock clicks at last. Wren lets out a quiet breath and pushes the door open.<<pass 5>>
	<br><br>
	"Nothing to it," <<he>> says. But you can see the sweat on <<his>> temples.
<<else>>
	The lock will not open. Wren tries again, slower this time. Your heart jumps into your throat. At last the lock opens.<<pass 8>>
	<br><br>
	"That one fought back," <<he>> admits.<<set $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel += 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Beyond the door, the vault floor opens up. It is not one room, but a set of narrow corridors. Numbered deposit boxes line the walls and vanish into the dark.
Behind a glass wall sits a computer station. Several screens there, all dark.
<br><br>
<<link [[Approach the terminal|Heist Terminal]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Terminal
<<effects>>
The glass wall slides open at your touch. That feels wrong at once. The place feels as if it has been waiting for someone to touch it.
<br><br>
Wren stays at the corridor entrance, eyes on the dark beyond. "Five minutes. Find the accounts, copy the access codes, get out."
<br><br>
You sit at the terminal. Screens come to life one by one. No password prompt. No lockout. Account books, transfer records, payment plans. The sort of information people kill to keep hidden.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Terminal 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Heist Terminal 2
<<effects>>
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 7 "skulduggery">>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success" and $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel lt 3>>
	Your fingers move quickly. You find the master account and copy the access codes to a blank card.
	Transfer complete. You pocket the card.
	<br><br>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>"I've got it," you whisper.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>"It's done," you whisper.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>"Done and dusted," you whisper, breathless.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>"Got it," you whisper. "Move."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>"It's mine," you whisper.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>"Got it," you whisper. "Let's go."
	<<else>>"Got it," you whisper.<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Wren nods. "Then let's..."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> stops. <<His>> eyes widen, fixed on something behind you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Turn around|Heist Success Master]]>><</link>>
<<elseif _heistStealthResult is "success" or $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel lt 4>>
	Your fingers fumble at first, but you find your rhythm. You find the master account record and copy the access codes.
	<br><br>
	<span class="red">An alarm chimes in the distance</span>.
	<br><br>
	"Time's up," Wren hisses. "Move!"
	<br><br>
	You pocket the card and run. <span class="navy">A shape at the far end of the corridor catches your eye.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Keep running|Heist Success Master]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The terminal locks. A harsh buzz fills the air. The walls begin to vibrate.
	<br><br>
	Wren swears. "<span class="red">They know we're here</span>."
	<br><br>
	Bright lights fill the vault floor. Footsteps come from multiple directions.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Run for it|Heist Failure]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Surrender|Heist Failure Surrender]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Heist Success Master
<<effects>>
You stop. Just for a moment.
<br><br>
A figure stands at the far end of the corridor. Perfectly still. The weak emergency light catches something jutting from their face.
<<if $hallucinations gte 1>>
	Antlers branch from where their eyes should be, pale as silver bone. The sockets beneath them are dark and hollow.
<<else>>
	It might be antlers, or a strange mask. It is hard to tell in the half-light.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $awarelevel gte 5>>
	<span class="erase-from-history"><span class="navy">You've felt this presence before. In the temple. In the forest. This is something old.
	</span></span>
<<else>>
	Something about the figure makes every part of you want to look away.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The carved crescent smile on the mask catches the emergency light.<<awareness 2>><<ggawareness>><<trauma 30>><<gggtrauma>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Success Master 2]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Success Master 2
<<effects>>
"<span class="red">Don't look at it</span>," Wren hisses, grabbing your arm. <<His>> voice is rough with fear. "Don't. Look. Move."<<stress 2>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
<<He>> pulls you away. But you look back.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Success Master 3]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Success Master 3
<<effects>>
The figure tilts their head.
<br><br>
Then the emergency lights flicker, and they're gone.
<br><br>
<<link [[Flee|Heist Escape]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Escape
<<effects>>
The two of you run back through the vault corridors, up the staircase, through the service door, and into the utility corridor.
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 5 "athletics">>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	But the corridor is empty. No one upstairs seems to know what happened in the vault.<<pass 21>>
<<else>>
	And a guard comes round the corner ahead. You see each other at the same moment. <<pass 30>>
	<br><br>
	Wren slams shoulder-first into the guard. <<He>> goes down.
	<br><br>
	"Keep moving!" Wren shouts.<<gstress>><<stress 4>><<set $xchange.bankHeist.alertLevel += 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Flee|Heist Escape 2]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Escape 2
<<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<set $bus to "high">>
You reach the maintenance hatch.
<br><br>
Wren pushes you through first, then follows. Outside at last. Cold night air hits your face. Your hands will not stop shaking. The card is still in your pocket.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Escape Earpiece]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Escape Earpiece
<<effects>>
You lean against the wall, gasping. Your lungs burn from the run.<<tiredness 21>><<gggtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>"Did that really just happen?" you whisper.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>"Tell me that was real," you whisper, still staring into the rain.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>"Please tell me you saw that too," you say under your breath.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>"Well. That was horrible," you whisper, pressing the back of your hand to your mouth.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>"That thing was there," you say softly. "I know it was."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>"We got out," you say, forcing air back into your lungs. "That's what matters."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>"Whatever that was, I never want to see it again," you mutter.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>"Well," you manage between breaths, "that was terrifying."
<<else>>"We did it," you say. It doesn't feel real.<</if>>
<br><br>
Wren shakes <<his>> head. "The thing at the end. I've heard stories about <span class="elk">the master</span>." <<He>> meets your eyes. "The stories were true."
<br><br>
Mickey's voice crackles in your ear, making you flinch. "You're out? Good-good. Now destroy the earpiece. Right now. Snap it and drop it in a drain."
<br><br>
<<link [[Destroy the earpiece|Heist Escape Destroy]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Pocket it for now|Heist Escape Keep]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Escape Destroy
<<effects>>
You pull the earpiece out and snap it between your fingers. The pieces fall into a storm drain.
<br><br>
Silence. Mickey is gone.
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.hasEarpiece to false>>
<<link [[Next|Heist Escape Final]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Escape Keep
<<effects>>
You hesitate, then keep the earpiece. Mickey's line goes dead.
<br><br>
<span class="red"><i>You might put Mickey in danger.</i></span>
<br>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.keptEarpiece to true>>
<<link [[Next|Heist Escape Final]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Escape Final
<<effects>>
Wren stands and steadies <<himself>>.
<br><br>
"<span class="teal">Take the card to Landry</span>. <<nnpc_He "Landry">> needs to see it. And be careful. Whatever that thing was, it saw us."
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.heistComplete to true>>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak to null>>
<<set $wrenSeenLast to "heist">>
<<set $wrenSeen.pushUnique("heist")>>
<<crimeicon "plunder">><<link [[Disappear into the night|Forest]]>><<endevent>><<pass 30>><</link>>

:: Heist Failure
<<effects>>
You run for the staircase. Wren is ahead. The footsteps behind you are fast, and getting closer.
<<bankHeistStealthCheck 8 "athletics">>
<<if _heistStealthResult is "success">>
	You reach the staircase. Wren holds the door. You throw yourself through.
	<br><br><<pass 10>>
	A hand catches your ankle. You hit the floor. More hands drag you back.
	<br><br>
	Wren hesitates, face twisted. Then <<he>> mouths one word. <span class="red">"Sorry."</span> Then <<he>> is gone.
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	A body slams you into the wall. Stars burst across your vision. Wren's footsteps fade into the distance. <<He>> got away. <span class="red">You did not</span>.<<pass 15>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Mickey's voice in your ear: "Destroy the earpiece. Now."
<br><br>
<<link [[Crush the earpiece|Heist Failure Earpiece]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[No time|Heist Failure 2]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Failure Surrender
<<effects>>
You raise your hands.
<br><br>
Wren stares. "What are you doing?" <<he>> hisses. You shake your head. There is no way out.
<br><br>
<<He>> looks at you for one long moment. Then <<he>> runs. The guards close in. One pulls out a zip tie.
<br><br>
Mickey: "The earpiece. Destroy it. Please."
<br><br>
<<link [[Crush the earpiece|Heist Failure Earpiece]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[No time|Heist Failure 2]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Failure Earpiece
<<effects>>
You jam your hand against your ear and crush the earpiece. The case cracks. A sharp piece cuts your ear. The signal dies.
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.hasEarpiece to false>>
The guards grab your arms. One notices the blood on your ear. "What did you just do?"
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>"Nothing," you say, though your voice catches.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>"N-Nothing," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>"Nothing worth your concern," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>"Nothing," you say, meeting the guard's stare.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>"Nothing that concerns you," you say.
<<else>>"Nothing," you say.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Failure 2]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Failure 2
<<effects>>
You are dragged upstairs, through corridors you did not know, and put in a small room with no windows. The guards say nothing.
<br><br>
Then the police arrive. They take your details, take your prints, and charge you. Breaking and entering. Trespassing. <i>Attempted grand theft</i>.
<br><br>
<span class="red">You've been arrested.</span>
<br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Failure 3]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Failure 3
<<effects>><<crimeUp 5000>>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.heistFailed to true>>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.failDay to Time.days>>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.sneak to null>>
<<if $xchange.bankHeist.hasEarpiece>>
	While they handle your arrest, an officer pulls the earpiece from your ear. They bag it as evidence. <span class="red">Mickey's signal trail is exposed.</span>
	<<set $xchange.bankHeist.earpieceCompromised to true>>
	<<set $xchange.bankHeist.hasEarpiece to false>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
As the officers lead you away, you catch a glimpse through the bank's glass doors. A shape waits on the upper floor. <span class="navy">The outline of antlers</span>.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Police Prison Intro]]>><<endevent>><<pass 30>><<generatePolice 1>><<generatePolice 2>><</link>>

:: Heist Failure Landry
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<npc Landry>><<person1>>
Landry takes one look at you and understands. <<He>> slides a drink across the bar and waits.
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>"I'm sorry," you say. "I failed."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>"It went wrong," you say quietly, fingers tightening around the glass.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>"It failed," you say. "I'm sorry."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>"Well, that ended in ruin," you say, though there is no brightness in it.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>"We lost it," you say softly. "I'm sorry."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>"It went wrong," you say. "Wren got out."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>"It failed," you say flatly. "That is the truth."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>"Before you say 'I told you so'..."<br><br>"I wasn't going to," <<he>> says quietly.
<<else>>"It went wrong," you say.<</if>>
<br><br>
Landry exhales. "I heard. News travels fast." <<He>> taps <<his>> fingers on the bar. "Wren?"
<br><br>
"Got away."
<br><br>
<<He>> nods. "Good. <<nnpc_Hes "Wren">> too useful to lose."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Heist Failure Landry 2]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Failure Landry 2
<<if $xchange.bankHeist.earpieceCompromised>>
	<<set $pubfame.status to "hiding">><<set $pubfame.timer to 21>>
	Mickey's door opens a crack. "They got the earpiece?" Their voice is flat.
	<br><br>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>"I'm sorry," you say. "I tried."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>"I'm sorry," you say, and for once there is nothing playful in your voice.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>"I'm sorry," you say. "I should have destroyed it sooner."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>"I'm sorry," you say. "It was a mess."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>"Sorry," you say.
	<<else>>"I'm sorry," you say.<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"Don't apologise. Just stay away from me for a while. I need to move some things." The door shuts. The lock clicks harder than usual.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<He>> looks at you. "This doesn't change anything. The bank still has weak points. We just need to regroup. 
<<if $xchange.blackmail.intro is 1>>For now, damage control."<<else>>"For now, lay low."<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.heistFailureTold to true>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Heist Retry Letter
<<effects>>
You unfold the note. No name, no address. The handwriting is cramped but careful.
<br><br>
<i>The dust has settled. Our friend is back.</i><br>
<i>If you want to finish what we started, come.</i><br>
<i>They changed guard routes, but the main weakness is there.</i><br>
<i>If anything, they are more careless. Think they've won.</i><br>
<i>Let's prove them wrong.</i>
<br><br>
<i>- P.S. Wren says <<nnpc_he "Wren">> owes you a drink.</i>
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.bankHeist.retryLetterRead to true>>
<<bankHeistRetryReset>>
<<link [[Burn the note|Heist Retry Letter Burn]]>><</link>>

:: Heist Retry Letter Burn
<<effects>>
You hold the note over a candle. The paper catches, curls, and turns to ash. No trace left.
<br><br>
Landry would approve.
<br><br>
<span class="green"><i>The heist is back on. Talk to Landry at the pub.</i></span>
<br>
<<link [[Next|Bedroom]]>><</link>>